    {
      "position": 3,
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "text": "for #\u0001 \n\r\ni was told:\n\r\nどんな人も、入る事はできません sounds odd. \n\r\nmore natural are:\n\r\n誰も入る事はできません\n\r\n誰も入れません\n\n\n\r\nbut these arent examples of \u0001!\n\r\nis there a reason this might sound uncomfortable?",
      "html": "for <b><a href=\"http://jgram.org/pages/viewOne.php?tagE=donna#\u0001\">#\u0001</a></b> <br/>\r\ni was told:<br/>\r\nどんな人も、入る事はできません sounds odd. <br/>\r\nmore natural are:<br/>\r\n誰も入る事はできません<br/>\r\n誰も入れません<br/>\n<br/>\r\nbut these arent examples of <b><a href=\"http://jgram.org/pages/viewOne.php?tagE=\u0001\">\u0001</a></b>!<br/>\r\nis there a reason this might sound uncomfortable?",
      "source_id": null,
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "text": "どんなに飲んでももっとほしい\n\r\n→\n\r\nどんなに飲んでももっと欲しくなる",
